Error [E0164]: Compound assignment can't target an indexed slot.
  --> tests/ui/compound_index_target.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     counts["missing"] += 1
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A compound update reads an indexed slot before it writes; that read can panic when a map key is missing.
 Fix: Write a total update, such as `map[key] = (map.get(key) ?? 0) + 1`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0164

Error [E0164]: Compound assignment can't target an indexed slot.
  --> tests/ui/compound_index_target.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     counts["missing"] -= 1
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A compound update reads an indexed slot before it writes; that read can panic when a map key is missing.
 Fix: Write a total update, such as `map[key] = (map.get(key) ?? 0) - 1`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0164
